 beef empanada, a delicious meat-filled pastry served with parsley-packed chimichurri sauce.&quot;,&quot;blurb&quot;:null,&quot;interesting_facts&quot;:[&quot;Cabernet Sauvignon accounts for just over 17% of the red grapes grown in Argentina. &quot;,&quot;Some of the highest altitude vineyards in the world are from Argentina, and some of the best of these sky-high wines are composed of Cabernet Sauvignon. &quot;],&quot;body&quot;:4,&quot;body_description&quot;:&quot;Encorpado&quot;,&quot;acidity&quot;:3,&quot;acidity_description&quot;:&quot;Alto&quot;,&quot;country&quot;:{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;ar&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Argentina&quot;,&quot;native_name&quot;:&quot;Argentina&quot;,&quot;seo_name&quot;:&quot;argentina&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;ARS&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Peso argentino&quot;,&quot;prefix&quot;:&quot;$&quot;,&quot;suffix&quot;:null},&quot;regions_count&quot;:47,&quot;users_count&quot;:750213,&quot;wines_count&quot;:41879,&quot;wineries_count&quot;:5700,&quot;most_used_grapes&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:9,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Malbec&quot;,&quot;seo_name&quot;:&quot;malbec&quot;,&quot;has_detailed_info&quot;:true,&quot;wines_count&quot;:219735,&quot;parent_grape_id&quot;:null,&quot;color&quot;:5},{&quot;id&quot;:2,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Cabernet Sauvignon&quot;,&quot;seo_name&quot;:&quot;cabernet-sauvignon&quot;,&quot;has_detailed_info&quot;:true,&quot;wines_count&quot;:801751,&quot;parent_grape_id&quot;:null,&quot;color&quot;:5},{&quot;id&quot;:5,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chardonnay&quot;,&quot;seo_name&quot;:&quot;chardonnay&quot;,&quot;has_detailed_info&quot;:true,&quot;wines_count&quot;:604208,&quot;parent_grape_id&quot;:null,&quot;color&quot;:1}]},&quot;wine_type_id&quot;:1,&quot;food&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:4,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Carne de vaca&quot;,&quot;weight&quot;:0.5,&quot;background_image&quot;:{&quot;location&quot;:&quot;//images.vivino.com/backgrounds/foods/4_beef.png&quot;,&quot;variations&quot;:{&quot;small